      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-027\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19093]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>14.  </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>ANC OF UNCOMPLICATED PREGNANCIES:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19094]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Primi</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gravida</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 10 appointments/ visits.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19095]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Multi</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gravida</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> \u2013 7 appointments/visits.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:176.95pt;\"><col style=\"width:362.55pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Time of appointment</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Objective</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">1st contact with health care professional</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Information giving</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Folic acid till 12 weeks of pregnancy, 400\u00b5g daily.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Food hygiene.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Life style \u2013 (smoking cessation, recreational drug use, alcohol abuse.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">AN screening, risk/benefits.</p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Discuss issues.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Ask questions.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Booking by 10 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Information giving regarding</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">How baby develops</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Nutrition, diet including vitamin D 10mg/ day.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Exercise, including Pelvic floor.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Antenatal screening.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Pregnancy care pathway.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Place of birth, Breast feeding.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">AN classes.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Maternity benefits.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Screening Tests:</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">1. Blood group + Antibodies.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2. Screening for Hemoglobinopathies.</p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Offer to all.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Types of screening depends upon prevalence:</li></ul><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>High &gt; 1.5/10,000 high performance chromatography.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Less &lt; 1.5/ 10,000.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:108pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"158a4c0a516b0434bce9c51a\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-027\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 158a4c0a516b0434bce9c51a\" viewbox=\"2486025 152400 38100 171450\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"4158b9463f06d66a9909f2266f9d99f3e020d2e58dbeab95018ed2f6a11e9ee5\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"f06741c726d8c3d1aeae\" transform=\"translate(2497622 159953)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 116305\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Family origin Questionnaire.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"41e090fd10270859ab56ae49\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-027\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 41e090fd10270859ab56ae49\" viewbox=\"838200 47625 3124200 314325\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"4b850961129849b954aa487176344807eea037ddaa4a92009e00bc9b35d11bb7\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-c11baf2a8fb5f1937a06\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker><marker id=\"arrow-end-e2be774a5dd7c0fb3acc\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"6ed26b6e8a6173636e92\" transform=\"translate(961590 105343)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2891589 1\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"c11baf2a8fb5f1937a06\" transform=\"translate(963224 106186)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2823 127000\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-c11baf2a8fb5f1937a06)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"e2be774a5dd7c0fb3acc\" transform=\"translate(3852968 100542)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 143933\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-e2be774a5dd7c0fb3acc)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure><span hidden data-mm-figure-member=\"41e090fd10270859ab56ae49\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:tbl[106]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[2]/w:p[18]/w:r[2]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]\"></span><span hidden data-mm-figure-member=\"41e090fd10270859ab56ae49\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:tbl[106]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[2]/w:p[18]/w:r[3]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}AlternateContent[1]/{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">           High risk                                                                          low risk</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"15fc85cb78f40f09bd8ea2d9\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-027\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 15fc85cb78f40f09bd8ea2d9\" viewbox=\"828675 -38100 247650 381000\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"b067da8f540963fab921326469496e9befbb4880b109621032040dc5018f877d\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#4472C4\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b\" transform=\"translate(953347 9313)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 4233 220134\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">           High performance</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">           chromatography</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">MCV &lt; 27 =&gt; High performance liquid chromatography</p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Female carrier =&gt; check partner status.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Heel prick =&gt; neonate.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">3. Anemia, Hep B, HIV, syphilis.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">4. Asymptomatic bacteriuria.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">5. Chlamydia \u2013 no test but information given if age is &lt; 25 years.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">6. Dating scan, 10 \u2013 13+6 weeks (CRL up to 84mm, then HC).</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">7. Height, weight, BMI, B.P, proteinuria, risk factor for PTE, GDM.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">8. Screening for down to all women.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Combined: 11 \u2013 13+6 weeks.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Tripple/ Quadruple: after 15 weeks.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">9. Identify genital mutation.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">10. Ask about past/ present mental health illness, depression.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">11. Occupation \u2013 identify occupational hazards.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">12. Support @ home \u2013 rule out domestic abuse, deprivation.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">@ 16 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Discuss and preview results of screening.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Reassess plan and pattern of care.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Investigate, Hb &lt; 11 and give iron.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>B.P, proteinuria.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0B7\" data-source-marker-font=\"Symbol\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u2022</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Give information, discussion.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">18 \u2013 20 weeks.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Anomaly Scan &amp; its purpose (NT &gt;6mm, 2 or more soft markers).</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"698a8c437682439f066f8e00\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-027\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 698a8c437682439f066f8e00\" viewbox=\"3771900 0 200025 304800\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"2cc9b74755616b6fcaf79b522f2c014fff5b485d06ffaf0529b9093ad9c6d0d6\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"696b7e6c968dbfc59922\" transform=\"translate(3806288 11235)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 187569 L 29307.5 187569 L 29307.5 0 L 87922.5 0 L 87922.5 187569 L 117230 187569 L 58615 246184 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#5B9BD5\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Reproductive choices.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"><figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"9b61b483cb30f5ea08898640\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-027\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 9b61b483cb30f5ea08898640\" viewbox=\"3629025 28575 1066800 542925\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"5e38d270ea874f33b3d7079ebccdce4b6f15ed8e2799f3a96a5952b7caafbf7e\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"ddd1457abba4e0655386\" transform=\"translate(3636303 34485)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1055077 0 L 1055077 527539 L 0 527539 Z\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-opacity=\"0\" stroke-width=\"6350\"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor=\"t\" transform=\"translate(0 45720)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"91440\" y=\"152400\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"></text></g></g></g></svg></figure>Prepare pts for (treatment, disability, TOP).</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"> 4 camber view of heart &amp; outflow track routinely.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">25 weeks.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Only Nulliparous</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">SFH.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">B.P, proteinuria</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Discussion, information.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">28 weeks </p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2nd screen for:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Anemia.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Atypical Ab.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Anti D prophylaxis.</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">SFH plotting.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">B.P proteinuria.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Information, discussion.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">31 weeks.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Nulliparous B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">SFH, plot.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Information + discussion.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Review screening tests done @ 28 weeks.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Replan care pathway if any problem detected</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">34 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Information, discussion.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Prepare for birth including pain &amp; birth plan, coping with pain.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Recognition of active labor.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2nd dose Anti D.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">SFH plot.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Review screening tests @ 28 weeks</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">36 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Information, discussion.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">B.F information.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Care of new born. </p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Vitamin K prophylaxis + Neonatal screening.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Post \u2013 natal care.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Baby blue awareness &amp; post \u2013 natal depression.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Check:</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">B.P, protein uria, SFH.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Baby position \u2013 Breach =&gt; offer ECV.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">38 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">SFH.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">Information, Discussion.</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">40 weeks</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Nulliparous</p><p style=\"margin:0;padd